      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kief%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office opened in 1909, and Kief was officially incorporated as a village in 1916, cementing its community status.",
